      "type": "negative_control",
      "statement": "Configuration PATCH, manual dry-run, and approval mutations match the ASGI path independently of root_path, require one unencoded application/json media type with at most one UTF-8 charset, and bound bytes, depth, and ambiguous JSON before executor lookup. Strict DTOs reject coercion and authority fields; admitted manual/webhook payloads and READ requests are schema-validated before external execution with safe non-reflective failures.",
      "test_refs": [
