      "id": "sealed-read-output-before-artifact",
      "type": "negative_control",
      "statement": "Controlled READ snapshots the exact caller command before its first await, detaches the operation, recompiles contracts, validates input before reservation, and passes adapter.execute a disposable request. Exact-matched results face private canonical byte/token/depth/schema checks before detached reconstruction for artifacts. Caller, adapter, or late mutation and hostile/invalid output cannot alter authority, persistence, or completion-denial audit identity.",
